    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zeleny woke up from a deep sleep and can\u2019t remember anything. Join him as he discovers what had happened while exploring a maze-like 2D world full of dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zeleny Grimn is a Metroidvania Run N\u2019 Gun video game. You\u2019ll play Zeleny, a small creature, as you explore a vast world filled with dangers and unsolved mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the maze-like paths and test your skills against various dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obtain new skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new skills that will help you tackle whatever comes your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may enhance your skills and equip them with objects that will boost your attacks even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Face great dangers </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to overcome all your enemies. Showcase your skills by defeating them in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront numerous enemies with diverse mechanics, each more powerful than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Characteristics </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 Shot Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Power-Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Comic-Style Kinematics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expansive World to Explore </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zeleny woke up from a deep sleep and can\u2019t remember anything. Join him as he discovers what had happened while exploring a maze-like 2D world full of dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zeleny Grimn is a Metroidvania Run N\u2019 Gun video game. You\u2019ll play Zeleny, a small creature, as you explore a vast world filled with dangers and unsolved mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the maze-like paths and test your skills against various dangers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obtain new skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new skills that will help you tackle whatever comes your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may enhance your skills and equip them with objects that will boost your attacks even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Face great dangers </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to overcome all your enemies. Showcase your skills by defeating them in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront numerous enemies with diverse mechanics, each more powerful than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Characteristics </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 Shot Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Power-Ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Comic-Style Kinematics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expansive World to Explore </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Join Zeleny on his adventure through the Dardaglia region and unveil all the mysteries hidden within it. Explore maze-like paths and test yourself as you face numerous dangers while unlocking new skills.",
